{"kind":"grammar","lang":"en","entities":{"n2-043":{"renderings":[{"id":"bb08bcd57d1ce9d0","role":"prose","field":"shortExplanation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n2-043"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"Expresses the meaning of 'without worth', 'in vain', 'fruitless'."},{"id":"6de88d6f65aad200","role":"prose","field":"longExplanation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n2-043"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"The ～かいもなく grammar point is used to express that something has been done without worth, in vain, or fruitlessly. It often appears as 'Verb-た + かいもなく' or 'Noun + の + かいもなく' to indicate that an effort did not produce the hoped-for result."},{"id":"683b2f65b5b88c9a","role":"prose","field":"formation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n2-043"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"Verb-た + かいもなく / Noun + の + かいもなく"},{"id":"2ecd35b002ff1c62","role":"prose","field":"usageNote","source":{"source":"gokan","ref":"n2-043"},"match":"id","status":"reviewed","value":"かいもなく: the effort was in vain."},{"id":"2e4e09ff35069847","role":"label","field":"family","source":{"source":"gokan","ref":"worth"},"match":"id","status":"reviewed","value":"Worth (Worth Doing / In Vain / Bearable)","of":{"kind":"family","id":"worth"}}]},"n2-043#22949ef2a9c3":{"renderings":[{"id":"233412d8f8fb8c8d","role":"translation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n2-043"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"I struggled for a long time, but in the end, it was all in vain and I failed."}]},"n2-043#d892d239ad85":{"renderings":[{"id":"ff5b692eda971f42","role":"translation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n2-043"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"I spent a lot of time on this project, but it ended fruitlessly."}]},"n2-043#89d485dfb5c7":{"renderings":[{"id":"5318aa996d8f624d","role":"translation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n2-043"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"He asked for help, but it was in vain as no one came."}]},"n2-043#0d9def1b03aa":{"renderings":[{"id":"bdd1e46e3c87eb6c","role":"translation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n2-043"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"I tried various diet methods, but it was all for nothing—I didn't lose any weight."}]}}}